=== the book that CANNOT earn the survivors' premium ===
Each name's persistent position, measured on TRAIN and removed from
the test book -- known at the split, so this is a book, not a
decomposition. The universe holds ZERO names that died in 27 years,
so a permanent long in the survivors pays by construction.
